<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="ZEC" style="id">Zekariah</book>
  <para style="h">Zekariah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zekariah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zekariah</para>
  <para style="mt">Zekariah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Darius vaihawm akum ni na, aha gietna ah Iddo tapa Berekiah, Berekiah tapa guolnei Zekariah kung ah Mangpa thu ahing tung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Napu napate uh tungah Mangpa ana lungthah mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuaziehin nang akung uah, galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, va chiin, galkapte Mangpa’n Kei kungah hing kinuale un, Kei zong nou kung ah ka hing kinua le ding hi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na pu na pate uh bangin umsih un, guolnei masaten amaute kungah, na umdan giloute uleh na sil hoilou bawlte ua kipat in hing kinuahei un, ana chi ua, hinanleh kei ahing ngaikhe ut sih ua, ahing thudon sih uhi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Napu napate uh hei ah a umta uoi? Tualeh guolneite zong kumtawnin ahing den uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanleh ka thute leh, ka thugousiete ka suoh guolneite kunga, ka thupiehte’n napu napate uh adelpha sih amah? Tuachi’n amaute akinuahei ua, galkapte Mangpa’n itung ua bawl ding atup bangin, i umdan bang leh isilbawlte dungzui in itung uah abawlta hi,” achi uhi, chiin, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Darius vaihawm akum ni na, aha sawm leh khatna tua khu Shebat ha ahia, ani sawmni leh li na ah Iddo tapa Berekiah, Berekiah tapa guolnei Zekariah kungah Mangpa thu ahing tunga:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Zanlai in mengmuna ka mu a, Ngai vawi, mi khat sakol san tunga tuong, phaihawm a muising lah ah ading a, tualeh anua lang ah sakol san, abuong leh akang a um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ken ka Mangpa aw tamte bang ahi uoi? Ka chi hi. Tuachi’n kei hing houpi vansawlsiengin ka kungah, tamte bang ahi uoimah ka hing ensah ding hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh muising lah a dingpa’n, ahing dawnga, Tamte leitung pumpi tuonsuoh dinga Mangpa’n asawlte ahi uh, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaun muising lah a Mangpa vansawlsieng khu adawng ua, Leitung pumpi ka tuonsuoh zouta ua, tualeh Ngai vawi, leitung pumpi sip dide in akhawldam khipkhep hi, achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa vansawlsiengin adawnga, Aw galkapte Mangpa, Jerusalem leh Juda gam khopite tungah kum sawmsagi sung vingveng na lungthahta a, bang tanvei ahiei hepilou a na um nahlai ding, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n kei hing houpi vansawlsieng kungah thuhoi leh lungmuonhuoi thu in adawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Kei hing houpi vansawlsiengin ka kungah, galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi, chiin phuongkhie in, achi hi. Jerusalem leh Zion ka kihuhpi seng ziehin, ka sitse mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Anop aning a um namte tungah, ka lungthah mama hi; aziehpen tomnou khat a lungthah sung in, amaun asugenthei semsem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuaziehin Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Khotuona toh Jerusalem ah ka kinuale ding hi, asungah ka inn akilam kia ding a, tualeh Jerusalem tung ah tena khau akizan ding hi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Ka khopite kiningchinna in adim kia ding a, Mangpa’n Zion ahamuon kia ding a, tualeh Zion atel kia ding hi, chiin phuongzah kia nalai in,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n dahtou a ka et leh kii li ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tualeh kei hing houpi vansawlsieng kungah, “Tamte bang ahi uoi?” ka chi hi. Tuachi’n aman ahing dawnga, “Tamte pen, Juda, Israel leh Jerusalem thezah kiite ahi uh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n siakhengmi li ahing ensahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tualeh ken “Tamte bang bawl dinga hing pei ahi uoi?” Chiin ka dong hi. Tuachi’n ahing dawnga: “Tamte pen koima’n alu aphawhdoh zou nawnlou na dinga, Juda thezah kiite ahi uhi, hinanleh tam siakheng mite pen, Juda gam dou a Juda mite thezah dinga akiite uh sangsah namte, kiite paikhe ding leh notdoh dinga hing kuonte ahi uh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n dahdoh a ka et leh, akhut a tena khau tawi mi khat ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken “Hei a hawding na hiei?” chiin ka dong a, ama’n ka kungah, “Jerusalem bangchia a lien a, bangtan a sau ahiei, chi thei dinga hing pei ka hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh kei hing houpi vansawlsieng apeidoh a, vansawlsieng dang khat ama kimupi dingin ahing pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama kungah, “Tai inlen, tua tangvalpa kungah Asunga mihing leh ganta atam seng ziehin Jerusalem khu kulbaang neilou khopite banga luo in a um ding hi, chiin va gen in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aziehpen keima akimkot ah, meikuong kulbaang ka hi dinga, tualeh alah uah thupina ka hi ding hi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thou un, thou un, mallam gam akipat taimang un, Mangpa’n achi hi, aziehpen vanhui lite bangin noute ka hing kizalsah ta hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Oh! Zion kigelmangin, Nou Babilon tanu toh tengkhawmte.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aziehpen galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Thupina zouin Aman nang hing tomgam namte kungah kei ahing sawl a, aziehpen nou hing khoikha pouma a mit laidum khoikha ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“En un, Keima’n atung uah ka khut ka thinkhum dinga, amaute asuohte ua dingin galvanlah ahi ding uhi. Tuachi’n galkapte Mangpa’n kei ahingsawl ahi, chi na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw Zion tanu lasa inlen kipah in. Aziehpen ngai in, Kei kang pei dinga, na lah ua hing teng ding ka hi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuani chiengin nam tampite’n Mangpa azomta ding ua, tualeh amauh ka mite ahi ding; Tualeh kei na lah uah ka teng ding hi. Tuachi’n nouten galkapte Mangpa’n kei noute kunga ahing sawl ahi chi na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n gam siengthou a atanvou, dingin Juda aluo dinga, tualeh Jerusalem atel kia ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi zousiete aw Mangpa masangah sipdide in um un, Ama atenna mun siengthou akipat in ahing thoudohta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n vansawlsieng mai a siempulien Joshua ding, tualeh ama heh dinga aziet lam a Setan ding ahing ensah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mangpa’n Setan kungah, “Aw setan Mangpa’n nang ahing phawh heh! Jerusalem telpa Mangpa ngelin nang hing phawh heh! Tam mipa mei apat ki lahdoh meisel kuong hilou ahiei mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Joshua khu puon nieh deldul silin vansawlsieng mai ah ading hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tualeh Aman adawng a, amai a dingte kungah, “Apuonsil nieh deldulte lakhie un,” achi hi. Tualeh Aman Joshua kungah, “En in, nang akipat na khelnate ka hing lahmang piehta hi, tualeh puon manphate ka hing silsahta ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh ken, amaute kungah, “Alu ah diel siengthou khuh sah un” kachi nalai hi. Tuachi’n diel siengthou alu ah akhusah ua, tualeh puonte asilsah uhi. Tualeh Mangpa vansawlsieng akungah ading hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa vansawlsiengin Joshua thu ahil a, akungah;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Ka lampite zui a na pei a, ka thupiehte na zui leh, ka innsung vai nahawm dinga, tuamabangin, ka vaihawmna munte na enkol ding a, Tualeh tamna dingte lah a napei theina ding, mun kang pe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuin Siempulien Joshua aw, Nang leh na mai atou na seppite’n ngai un: Amaute khu sil hing tung dingte, chiemtena lamdangte ahi uhi; Aziehpen Ngai un, ka suoh Bameng khu ka hing puidoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />En un, tua suong Joshua masangah ka na koita hi, tua suong tungah mit sagi a um ding a, tua suong tungah akhuohthaw in lai ka giel ding hi; galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi; tualeh tua gam thulimlouna ni khat thu in ka lamang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin michin in agrepgui nuoi leh, atheipi kung nuoi a tou dingin, na innvengte uh na chielta ding uhi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuin kei hing houpi vansawlsieng ka kungah ahing kilekia a, imu lai phawnhal bangin ahing phawnghal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama’n ka kungah “Bang na mu ei?” ahing chi hi. Tuachi’n ken “Ka en a, sana siengset a kibawl thaumei tunna leh adawna noubem leh atunna tung a thaumei sagite leh atunga meivahgui lawng sagi toh kithuo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ban ah, a kunga Olive singkung nite, tua noubem zietlam ah khat, tualeh aveilam ah khat um ka mu hi,” ka chita hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken ka dawnga, “Kei hing houpi vansawlsieng kungah, ka mangpa tamte bang ahiei?” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n kei hing houpi vansawlsiengin ahing dawnga, ka kungah, “Tamte bang ahiei chi theilou nave maw?” ahing chi hi. Tualeh ken, “Theilou ka mangpa,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama’n ahing dawnga, ka kungah: “Tami Zerubbabel kunga Mangpa thu ahi: Thahatna in hilou in, silbawltheina zong hilou in, hinanleh ka hagau zal in, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw muol sang lienpi, nang koina hiei? Zerubbabel mai ah phaijang na hing suoh ding! A kungah Hepina, hepina chia kikou kawm in aman suong poimaw pen, ahing ladoh ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuabanah Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Zerubbabel khutte’n, Tami biehinn suongphum aphumta a, ama khutte mama in alam zou ding hi. Tuachi’n galkapte Mangpa’n na kung uah, kei ahing sawl hi, chi na thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen koi ahiei sil neunoute ni simmaw? Kipah tah in a um ding ua, Zerubbabel khut a khaitang amu ding uhi. “Tam sagite khu Mangpa mit ahi ua, leitung pumpi en chien a asuh atou a vah kawite ahi uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken ka dawng a akung ah, “Thaumei tunna zietlam leh veilam panga um tam Olive singkung nite bang ahiei?” Ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh ka dongkia nalai a, akungah, “Sana meivahgui lawng nite kunga um, tam Olive ba nite apat a sana thaumei tui ahing luon khieh zelna khu bang ahiei?” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama’n kei ang dawng a, “Tamte bang ahiei chi theilou nave maw?” ahing chi hi. Tualeh ken “Theilou ka mangpa,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n ama’n “Tamte pen leitung pumpi Mangpa kung a ding, sathau kinu nite ahi uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tualeh kihei a ka dahdoh leh laibu ziel leenglai ka muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tualeh ama’n ka kungah, “Bang namu ei?” achi hi Tuachi’n ken “Laibu ziel leenglai ka mu hi, adung tong sawmni asau, avai tong sawm a lien” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n aman ka kungah, “Tami leitung pumpi tunga hamsie peisuoh khu ahi, tam laibu ziel pang lang khat a kigiel dungzuiin guta pouma akinotmang ding a, tualeh apang lelam a kigiel dungzui in dihlou tah a kichiem pouma akinotmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua hamsie khu ka sawldoh ding hi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi; guta innsung ah alut ding a, tualeh ka min a dihloutah a kichiemte inn sungah alut ding a, a umden dinga, asing asuong pum in akatum ding,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n Kei hing houpi vansawlsieng ahing pawtdoh a, ka kungah, “Khodah inlen, bang ahiei apawtdoh, en vawi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken “Bang ahiei?” chi’n ka dong hi. Tualeh ama’n “Tami tena seu peidoh ahi” achi hi. Tualeh ama’n “Gam sung pumpi a akhelna uh zong ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ngai in, tua seu husin ngeen a kibawl akihonga, tua seu sungah numei khat atou hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh vansawlsiengin, “Tami gitlouna ahi,” achi a! Seu sungah asawntum kia a, agong tungah ngeen husin in asinkhumta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n dahtou a ka et leh numei ni ahing pawt a tualeh a hate sungah hui a um a, amaun tuivapi ha bangbang ha anei ua, lei leh van kikaal ah tua tena seu adomtou uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuachi’n keiman ahing houpi vansawlsieng kungah, “Tam miten seu khu heilanga puoh sawm uh ahiei?” chiin ka dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tualeh ama’n ka kungah, “Shinar gam a inn lam ding a apuoh uh ahi, tualeh akilam zou chiengin akikoina ding mun tahah akikoi ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka kihei a, ka khodah a, ka et leh ngai vawi, muol ni kikaal apat in sakolleng li hing pei ka mu a, tualeh tua muolte khu sum-eng muolte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sakolleng masa pen ah sakol san ngen, aum ua, Sakolleng nina pen ah sakol vom ngen aum ua.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sakolleng thumna pen ah sakol kaang ngen, aum ua, Sakolleng lina pen ah sakol puong hattah ngen chi a um uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken ka dawnga, Kei hing houpi vansawlsieng kungah, “Tamte bang ahi uoi ka mangpa aw?” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n vansawlsieng in ahing dong a, ka kung ah, “Tamte vantunga hagau lite, leitung pumpi Mangpa mai a, a umna mun uapat a hing pawtdohte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sakol vomte kaipen mallam gam a pei ding ahi a, sakol kangte kai pen tum lam gam ah, tualeh sakol puongte kaipen simlam gam a pei ding ahi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n sakol hatte apeidohta ua, leitung pumpi tuonsuoh a apei theina ding uh angahla mama uhi. Tualeh ama’n “Leitung pumpi tuonsuoh dingin pei un,” achi hi. Tuachi’n leitung pumpi atuonsuohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh ama’n Kei ang han a, ahing houpi a, ka kungah, “En vawi, mallam gam zuon a peiten mallam gam ah ka hagau akhawldam sahta uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tung a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Babilon akipat a hing pei saltaangte, Heldai, Tobijah leh Jedaiah a kipat silpieh sana leh dangkate la inlen, tua ni main Zephaniah tapa Josiah inn ah lut in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua sana leh dangka, la inlen manglukhu khat bawl inlen Jehozadak tapa siempulien Joshua khusah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n akungah, galkapte Mangpa’n tambang in agen hi: “Ngai vawi, mi amin ABAMENG kichi! Ama mun apat ahing mengdoh ding a, Aman Mangpa biehinn alam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi, Aman Mangpa biehinn alam ding a, Aman thupina amu dinga, leengtoupha tunga tou in vai ahawm dinga, tuachi’n aleengtoupha tungah siempu ahi ding a, tualeh kilemna lemguotna, amauh tegel ah a um ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tualeh leenglukhute khu Helem kungah, Tobijah kungah, Jedaiah kungah, tualeh Zephaniah tapa Hen kungah, Mangpa biehinn athei zing nading un a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Gamlapi a umte nangawn ahing pei ding ua, Mangpa biehinn ahing lam ding uhi. Tuachi’n galkapte Mangpa’n noute kungah kei ahing sawl hi, chi na thei ding uhi. Tualeh Mangpa na Pasian uh aw, pilvang tah a na zui chinten u’leh tami ahing tangtung ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Darius leengpa vaihawm akum lina aha kuona Kislev ha, ani li niin Mangpa thu Zekariah kungah ahing tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bethel kho miten Sherezer leh Rege-Melek leh amite utoh, Mangpa mai a deisahna ngen dingin, Pasian inn ah asawlta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa inn a siempute leh guolneite kunga thu va dong ding in: “Kum tampi ka na bawlsa mabangin keima kituom koiin, aha ngana ah kap in ann ka ngawl diei mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuachi’n galkapte Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Gam sunga mi zousie kung leh siempute kungah vagen in: Apeisa kum sawm sagi sung aha ngana leh aha sagina teng a kap kawm a ann na ngawl chieng un, Kei a ding in, Kei a ding mama in na ngawl tahtah ngelna uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na neh ua na dawn chieng un zong nouma adinga kineh a kidawn hilou nahi uoi mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jerusalem leh akim apam a khopite a aten dim lai u’leh, nei lelam akiningchin lai uleh, simlam phaijang gam ngiemte a mi atendim lai ua, guolnei masate tungtawn a Mangpa thuphuon thute na zuisih di uoi mah?” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa thu Zekariah kungah ahing tunga;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: vaihawmna dihtah bawl unlen, Michin in asanggam tungah, Itna hepina leh lainatna ensah u’hen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Meithaite, leh pa neiloute, gamdang mi leh mi zawngte bawl genthei sih un. Na lah uah koiman asanggam sietna ding, alungtang ah geel sih heh,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh amauten athudon sih ua, aliengkoute uh asangsah ua, azah louna ding un abil uh ahum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi, amauten alungtangte uh meisa suong bangin atahsah ua, dan leh athute, galkapte Mangpa’n ahagau a guolnei masate tungtawn a athugente ana ngaikhe nuom sih uhi. Tuaziehin galkapte Mangpa akipat thangpaina ahing tungta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Tuaziehin, a thuphuonte angai nuomlou bangun, amauten ang hat chiengun ken zong ka ngaikhe sih ding hi,” galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Hinanleh atheikhah ngailou uh nam zousiete lah ah pingpei in amaute ka thethangta hi. Tambangin gam khu amaute nua in akilawi a asegawpta khunah koima vapei in ava tuon nawn sih ua, Koima zong akile kia sih uhi, gam hoi leh gam nuomtah segawp a akiloitah ziehin.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tung kia a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Thangsetah in Zion ka kihuhpi a deisahna thupitah toh, ama a dingin ka sitse mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Zion ah ka kinuale kia dinga, Jerusalem laikimtah ah ka teng dinga, Jerusalem khu thutah khopi akichi ding a, galkapte Mangpa muol khu Muol siengthou, akichi ding hi, a chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Jerusalem gawlzingte ah aputehte u’leh, pitehte uh atou kia ding ua, atehsiet sengtah ziehun, akhut uah chiengkhut atawi chiet ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua khopi gawlzingte ah, Pasal naupang leh numei naupangte, akholai chiet uah kimawl in adim ding uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Tam nite ah tam mite lah a umsunte, mitmu ah lamdang ahileh, Kei mitmu ah zong alamdang tuom sih ding amah? Gal kapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Ngai un, suolam gam akipat leh tumlam gam akipat, ka mite ka hundam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amaute ka hing nuapui kia dinga, Jerusalem ah ateng ding uhi. Thutah leh dihtatna in, amauh ka mite ahi ding ua, Kei a Pasian uh ka hi ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Bieh inn lamzou ahi theina dinga, galkapte Mangpa inn suongphum, kiphum ni a, guolneite kam a kipat thute, ana ngaikhie noute’n na khut uh hatsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aziehpen tam nite masangin, mihingte adingin kilawna ana um sih a, gantate ading in zong kilawna a um sih hi. Khum hunlai in koimapou apawtkhete leh, ahing lutte dingin, galte akipat in muonna a um sih hi; aziehpen michin a innvengte toh kidouin ka umsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanleh tu’nvang tam mipi umsunte, nidanglai bangin ka bawl nawn sih ding hi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aziehpen lemna haichi apou hoita dinga, grepguiten ga asuongta ding ua, leiin neh leh taah apungsah dinga, vanten daitui ape ding a, Ke’n tam mipi umsunte, tam silte zousie ka neisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tambang ahing hi ding: Namte lah a hamse thuoh nana hitah mabang un, Aw Juda innkuonte leh Israel innkuonte, Keima’n kang hundam ding a, noute guolzawlna nahi ding uhi. Zau sih unlen, na khutte uh hatsah un.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: “Napu napate un, ahing suhlungthah lai ua, hing gawt ding ka hi chia ka na tup khu, ka heng sih ding hi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuin vang Jerusalem leh, Juda innkuonte a ding in silhoi ka bawlpieh tup kiata hi, Zau sihun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tam silte ahi na bawl ding uh: Michin in na innvengte kung uah, thutah gen un, na kulkotpite uah thutah thudihna leh, lemna toh thukhen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Noute koima’n na innvengte uh, sietna ding na lungtang un ngaituo sih heh; Tualeh zuou a kichiem kilawp sih un, Aziehpen tam silte zousie ka huot ahi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuachi’n galkapte Mangpa thu ka kungah ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“Galkapte Mangpa’n tambang in agen hi: Aha lina a ann ngawl, Aha ngana a ann ngawl, Aha sagina a ann ngawl, Tualeh aha sawmna a ann ngawl khu, Juda innkuonte a dinga kipah thanopna leh, lungsim kilawptah a pawi bawlna ahi ding hi. Tuaziehin thutah leh lemna it un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“Galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: khopi tampi a teng, mipite ahing pei na lai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Khopi khat a tengte khopi dang ah apei ding ua, Mangpa mai a thungen ding in pei nalai vai, tualeh galkapte Mangpa suivai, kei zong hing pei vang, a chi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi, mi tampite leh nam hattahte, Jerusalem ah galkapte Mangpa sui ding leh, Mangpa mai a thungen dingin ahing pei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Tua ni chiengin ham chin leh, namchin akipat in mi sawm in, Juda mi khat puon mong atu ding ua, Pasian in noute ahing umpi hi, chi ka za ua, zawhkhawm vai aw achi ding uhi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hadrak gam a Mangpa thu, puohgih Damaska akingahna mun ding ahi, aziehpen mite leh Israel namte zousie mit Mangpa tungah atu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Akigamgitpi Hamath khopi tungah leh Tai-ar leh Sidon tung ah zong atung ding pil mama nan ule zong.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tai-ar in kulpi muonhuoi akibawlta a, dangka leivui bangin asie vum a, Sana siengset kholai buonnawi bangin asie vum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai vawi, Mangpa’n ama apaidoh dinga, Ama’n a silbawltheinate tuipi ah asumang ding a, Tualeh mei a haltum in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ashkelon in amu dinga azau ding, Gaza in zong amu dinga, alunggim mama ding; Ekron zong akinepna, agawtah ziehin, azum ding hi. Lengpa khu Gaza apat amangthai dinga, Ashkelon khu tenna lou in a um ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ashdod ah nam kipolzahte ateng dinga, Philistinte kiletsahna ka sumang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Akam sung ua kipat sisan ka lamang ding a, ahate uh kikaal a kipat in akidahhuoinate ka lakhe ding hi. Hinanleh a um nalaite ama ngel khu i Pasian ua ding ahi ding hi, tualeh ama khu Juda gam ah lamkai khat bang ahi ding a, tualeh Ekron khu Jebusmi bangin aum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka inn kim ah, veng mi bangin panmun kakho ding a, sugenthei mi koiman ama uh palsan in, apeisuoh in akinuale nawn sih ding hi, aziehpen tuin keima mit ngelin ka muta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Zion tanu nasatah in nuom in, Jerusalem tanu aw ngaitah in kikou in, En in, na leengpa na kungah ahing pei hi, Ama khu adih a, hundamna zong anei hi; Kingaingiem tah in, sabiltung nou tunga tuongin, sabiltung nou tung ngei a tuongin ahing pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ephraim apat sakollengte leh, Jerusalem apat sakolte ka sattan dinga, kidouna thalpite sattan in a um ding hi. Aman namte kungah lemna thu agen dinga, agam tuipi akipat tuipi dong ahi ding a; Tualeh luipi akipat leitung tawp dong ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang a dingin zong, Na thuhun sisan ziehin, tui umlouna kokhuh a kipat in, na suongkultaangte ka pawtkhe sahta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nou kinepna suongkultaangte aw, Kulpi lam ah kinuale kia un, tuni mama in aleni in ka hing pe ding hi, chiin ka phuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka thalpi bangin Juda ka luoi kun a, Ephraim thaltang in ka zanga, Aw Zion na tapate ka tohthou dinga, Na tapate’n ahing dou uhi. Aw Greece, Mihat namsau bangin ka hing bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n amaute tungah Mangpa, ahing kilang dinga, athaltangte kawlphe bangin aleengkhe dinga, tualeh Mangpa Pasian in pengkul amut dinga, simlam apat pumpai toh zawhin, apeikhawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa’n amauh aveng ding a, Amauten apumval ding ua, suongtanga sepin aguolzou ding uhi. A dawn ding ua, zukham bangin ahumham ding uhi. Belkuongte bangin sisan in adim ding ua, maitam ningte bangin adim ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin Mangpa a Pasian un, amite belam honte bangin ahundam ding hi. Amaute Manglukhu a suongmantamte bang ahi ding ua, agam tung ah puonlap bangin, dopsang in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahoina uh bangzatah a thupi a, akilawmna uh bangzata a loupi atai! Bu leh bal in tangvalte akhanghoi sah dinga, Tualeh uoin tha in nungahte akhanghoi sah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Guo nukhia zuh hun chiengin, Mangpa kungah guo ngen un. Guotui puo meilumte bawlpa Mangpa ahi a, Aman guo ahing zusah dinga, gamlah a hampa chinteng a dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Milim pasienten bangmalou thu agen ua, ai san siemte’n mengmuna zuou amu ua, mang dihlou gen in, athawn in mi ahamuon uhi. Tuaziehin mite belam bangin amauh lampi chiet ah avahthangta ua, aching ding belampu aumlou ziehin abuoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Belampute tungah ka lungthahna akuong a, alamkaite uh ka gawt ding hi. Aziehpen galkapte Mangpa’n abelamhon Juda innkuonte akem dinga amaute kidouna sakol hoitah bangin abawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama apat aninga suong, ama akipat puonbuh khetphim, ama akipat kidouna thalpi, ama akipat vaihawm mi zousie ahing pawtdoh ding ua, akikhawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amaute kidouna phuol gawlzing buonnawi lah a amelmate uh tuonchil mi hatte bangin a um ding ua, tualeh akung ua Mangpa a um ziehin adou ding ua, tualeh sakol tungtuongte azum sah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ken Juda innkuonte ka hatsah dinga, Joseph innkuonte ka hundam ding hi. Amaute ka lainat ziehin ka puikia ding hi. Amaute pen ka pampai ngailoute ma abang ding uhi. Aziehpen Kei Mangpa a Pasian uh ka hi a, Tualeh amauh ka ngaikhe ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ephraim mite khu mihat tungtuong bang ahi ding ua, Tualeh zu dawn bangin alungnuom ding uhi. Ahi, atate un tua khu amu ding ua, Mangpa ah alungtang uh akipah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ken amaute ka khutzap ding a, ka huoikhawm ding hi. Amaute ka tandoh dinga, nidang lai a apun bangun apung kia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Namte lah ah amaute ka the ding a, gam gamlapi apat kei ang thei zing ding uhi; khunah atate utoh atengkhawm ding ua, ahing kinuale kia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Izipt gam a kipat in amaute ka hing puidoh kia dinga, Assiria apat amauh ka khawm ding hi. Amaute Gilead gam leh Lebanon gam ah ka puilut ding a; ama ua ding a mun umlou khop in apung ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amaun gimthuohna tuipi apalsuoh ding ua, Tuipi a tuikihotte asat ding ua, tualeh luitui thuhtahte akangsan ding hi. Tuachi’n Assiria kiletsahna suhngiem in a um ding a, tualeh Izipt leeng chieng apeimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa ah amauh ka hatsah dinga, tualeh Ama min in avahsuh avahtou ding uhi,” Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lebanon na kotte hongin, na sidar singte meiin akahtum theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tapi sing aw, kap in mauin aziehpen sidar singte apuata hi, ahoi leh thupite susiet ahitah ziehun; Aw nou Bashan gangpi singte kap in mau un, gammang sing zousie akiphua siengta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Belampute kaa leh mauna ngaiun, aziehpen athupina uh asegawpta hi. Humpibahnei hawhging ngaiun, Jordan kisahtheina suhsiet ahitah ziehin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Mangpa Ka Pasian in tambang in agen hi, tha dingin belamhonte vaa in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aneiten amauh athat ua, khiel louin akingai uhi, tualeh amauh zuaten Mangpa phat in um hen, Kei ka hauta achi uhi, tualeh amauh chingten ahepi sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aziehpen gam sunga tengte ka hepi nawnsih ding, Mangpa’n achi hi. Hinanleh ngai in, michin ainnveng khut ah leh a leengpa khut ah ka pe ding hi. Amaun gam sung adou ding ua, tualeh ken amauh, akhut uapat ka hunkhe sih ding hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuachi’n thading belamhonte khu, ka vaa ding a diehin belamhon lah a azawngkhalte khu. Tualeh kei a dingin chieng ni ka lata a, khat khu Deisahna ka chi a, akhat pen kigawmna kachi hi. Tuachi’n belamhonte ka vah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ha khat sungin belampu thum ka paikhie hi. Ka hinna in amauh adeisih a, tualeh amauh hinna in kei ahing chimtah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuachi’n Ken, “Noute ka hing vaa nawn sih ding hi. Ashi shi shisuh u’henlen amang mang mangsuh heh. Ahingsunte khat leh khat kinetuo mai u’heh,” ka chi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tualeh ka chieng deisahna ka chi pen ka la a, tunni kasuo hi, tuachia namte toh ka bawlsa ka thuhun ka suhsiet theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuachi’n tuami ni mama in ka thuhun phel ahita, tualeh tambangin belamhonte lah a azawngkhal kei hing na ngahten, Mangpa thu ahi chi athei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n ken amaute kungah, “Hoi nasah u’leh ka thaman hing pie unlen, hoi nasah sih ulelah hing pieh daun,” ka chi hi. Tuachi’n ka thaman ding dangka sawmthum atedohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n ka kungah, “Ka man dinga kilawmhun asahza uh belkhengpa kungah paikhie in achi hi. Tuachi’n dangka sawmthum khu ka la a, belkhengpa a dingin Mangpa inn sung ah ka pailutta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n ka chieng dangkhat kigawmna ka chipen tunni suoin ka hiehtawnga, Juda leh Israel kikaal a ki unauna ka suhsiet theina dingin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh Mangpa’n ka kungah, “Belampu mo vanzahte nangma dingin kilah in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aziehpen ngai un, gam sungah belampu khat ka tungdoh dinga, ama’n amangte a sui dinga, anoute asui sih dinga, aliem abaite asudam sih ding a, adam nalaite zong ava sih ding hi. Hinanleh ama’n athaute sa ane dinga achinte nangawn uh atolkhiet pieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Belamhonte nuasie belampu pannabei tung agih hi! Namsau khu aban leh a mit zietlam tungah atu dinga, aban azoi dildel dinga, amit zietlam pumtawt in,” ataw ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel tungtanga Mangpa thu puohgih khu. Mangpa vante zahpal leh leitung kingahna suongphum phumpa leh mihing sunga um hagau siempa Mangpa’n tambang in agen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ngai vawi, Jerusalem zukhamna nou in ka bawl dinga, akim apam a miten Juda leh Jerusalem dou a a imtawm chiengun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuani chiengin tambang ahi dinga, Jerusalem khu mi zousie adingin suong gih mama in ka bawl dinga, leitunga mizousie adou dingin kikhawm nan u’leh, amazieh a tunggih kisate zousie satnen in a um ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin, sakol chinteng amhaina toh, tualeh atunga tuongte motna toh ka sat ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi. Tualeh Juda innkuonte tungah ka mit ka hahsah dinga, tualeh mite sakol chinteng mittawtna in ka sat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeh Juda uhpipaten alungtangun, Jerusalem a tengte khu galkapte Mangpa a Pasian uh ka hatna ahi, achi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Tua ni chiengin Juda uhpipate khu singkhuo lah a mei-am bangin ka bawl ding a, buphai lah a meisel kuong bangin ka bawl ding hi. Tualeh akim apama mite, ziet leh vei ah akatum ding uhi; hinanleh Jerusalem pen ama mun ah Jerusalem mun ngei ah mite’n aluokia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Mangpa’n Juda puon innte a hundam masa dinga, tuachi’n David innkuonte thupina leh Jerusalem a tengte thupina khu Juda thupina sangin athupi zaw sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin Mangpa’n Jerusalema tengte ahumbit dinga, tua ni chieng in alah ua hatlou pente nangawn David bang ahi ding ua, tualeh David innkuonte pen Pasian abang ding ua, amasang ua Mangpa vansawlsieng bang ahi ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin Jerusalem dou namte zousie suhmangna ding ka sui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Tualeh David innkuonte tung ah leh Jerusalem a tengte tungah hepina leh thugetna hagau ka sungbaw dinga; tuachi’n teipi a asutpa uh kei ahing en ding ua, tualeh mi’n atapa neisun a suun bangin Ama asuun ding ua, tualeh mi’n atachiil tunga athuohnat bangin athuohna ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin Jerusalem ah suunna thupitah a um dinga, Megiddo phaijang a Hadad Rimmon a suunna abang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tualeh gam in asuun ding a, innkuon chinin atuomin, David hahlesuonte innkuon toh atuom in, azite un, amau’tuom in, Nathan hahlesuonte innkuon ten amau’tuom in, tualeh azite un atuom in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Levi hahlesuonte innkuonten amau’tuom in, tualeh azite un atuomin, Shimei hahlesuonte innkuonten amauh tuom in, tualeh azite un atuom in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Innkuon dang um zousie in, innkuon chinteng in atuom in, tualeh azite un atuom chietin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tua ni chiengin David innkuonte leh Jerusalem a tengte dingin tuinah khat akihong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tua ni chiengin, gam sunga milimte minte ka subei dinga, theizing ahi nawn sih ding uhi. Ken guolneite leh hagau siengloute gam sunga pat in ka pawtsah sieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tualeh tambang ahi ding, mi koi ahiei in thumavang agen nahlai leh apienna nu leh pa’n, akungah Mangpa min a zuou thu nagen ziehin na hing sih ding hi, achi ding uhi. Tualeh apienna nu leh pa in thumavang agen laitah in adawtpailet ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin guolneite zousie’n amengmuna thu uh agen chiengun azum ding uhi. Mi solna dingin goulnei puontuol multe asil nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanleh ama’n Kei guolnei ka hisih, loubawl mi ka hibou hi. Ka neulai akipat ganhon kem ding a mi’n ahing hil ka hibou hi, achi zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tualeh mi koi ahiei in akungah na khut kaala liemnate khu bang ahiei? achi ding hi. Tuachi’n ama’n adawng ding a, Tamte khu ka lawmte inn a ka liem khahna ahi, achi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Kisa in, Aw ka namsau, ka belampu leh ka kigoppi kalawmpa dou dingin,” galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi. Belampu sat in, belamte akithethang ding uhi; Tuachi’n ken anoute tungah ka khut kaha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tualeh gam sung pumpia umte, sethumsuo seni sattan ahi ding a, ashi ding uh, Hinanleh sethum suo se khat nuasie ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keima’n sethum suo sekhat te, mei ah ka pailut dinga, dangka sia suhsieng bangin ka susieng dinga, tualeh sana etchien bangin ka enchien ding hi. Ka min in ang han ding ua, amauh ka dawng ding hi. Ken ka mite ahi uh kachi dinga; Amauten Mangpa ka Pasian uh ahi achi chiet ding uhi.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />En un, Mangpa ni hing tung ding ahita, tualeh na galsum lahte khu nouma lah a hawm ahi ding.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aziehpen Jerusalem dou dingin, nam zousie ka khawm dinga, tualeh khopi lahin a um dinga, innte suhsiet ahi dinga, numeite bawlsiet ahi ding uhi, khopi kimkhat sal a puimang in a um dinga, a umsunte pen khopi apat in suhmang ahisih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa akuondoh dinga, kidouna nia adou mabangin tua namte a dou ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin suolam a, Jerusalem mai ngat a um Olive muol tunga, akeng nga in ading ding a, tualeh Olive muol khu suolam leh, tumlam ah phal ni kisuo in akeh dinga, akaal ah phaijang lienpi a um ding hi, tua muol kimkhat mallam ah akikhin ding a, akimkhat simlam ah akikhin ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuachi’n noute ka muol kikaal phaijang ah, na taimang ding ua, aziehpen muol kikaal phaijang in Azal dong asuding hi. Ahi, Juda leengpa Uzziah dam lai a, zilling a ana tai mabang un, na taimang ding uhi. Tambangin Mangpa ka Pasian ahing pei dinga, amisiengthoute zousie toh ahing zawhkhawm ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin khuo avah sih dinga, amiel seng sam sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tam pen Mangpa adinga thei a um ni khat ahi dinga, sun hilou zan lah hilou, hinanleh nitah lam chiengin khuo avah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin Jerusalem apat in, tui hing aluongkhe dinga, akimkhat suolam tuipi ah, akimkhat tumlam tuipi ah nipi lai leh phalbi laiin zong, aluong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mangpa khu leitung pumpi ah leeng ahi dinga tua ni chiengin Mangpa khat ahi dinga, Amin zong khat ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gam sung pumpi Geba akipat Jerusalem simlam Rimmon dongin phaijang asuohta ding hi. Jerusalem tawisangin a um ding a, Benjamin kotpi akipat in kotpi masapen tan dongin leh aning a kotpi dongin, tualeh Hananeel innsanga pat leengpa grep tui suhna tandong, amun mama ah mite ateng dim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mite asungah ateng ding ua, sietna nasatah a um nawn sih dinga, Jerusalem ah bittah in akitengta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jerusalem dou mipite zousie tunga, Mangpa’n natna hii alensah ding khu tambang ahi: Akeng ua adin lai un atahsa uh amuotkhe dinga, amitte uh amitkhuh sung uah, amuot dinga, alei uh akam sung uah amuot ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin, hichi ahi dinga, Mangpa akipat buoina thupitah alah uah a um dinga, michin in a innveng khut atu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Juda in zong Jerusalem ah gal adou dinga, akim apama namte zousie hausatna sana, dangka nihten puonsil tampi akhawm khawm ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tambang natna hipi a gawtna pen, sakolte, sakol neute, sangawngsaute sabiltungte leh giehphuol a ganta zousiete tungah atung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tualeh Jerusalem dou a hing kuon namte zousie lah a, ahing sunte Lengpa galkapte Mangpa be dingin, tualeh Biehbuh pawite mang dingin kum simin Jerusalem ah akuontou ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tualeh koipou Lengpa galkapte Mangpa be dinga Jerusalem a peitou lou leitung a innkuonte zousie tungah guo azu sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Izipt innkuonte ahing peitou lou ua, ava hawsih ding uleh, guotui amu sih ding uhi; Mangpa biehbuh pawi mang ding a peilou namte tung ah Mangpa gawtna natna hipi amaute tung ah atung zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tami Izipt mite leh Biehbuh pawi mang dinga kuontou lou namte zousie gawtna ahi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin “MANGPA ADINGA SIENGTHOU” chiin sakol lawngte tungah khuoh thawin akigiel ding hi. Mangpa inn a belte khu maitam mai a noubemte bang ahita ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi, Jerusalem leh Juda gam a bel chinteng galkapte Mangpa a dinga siengthou ahing hita dinga, kithoina lan ding a hing pei pouma in tua belte ala ding ua, tuatein ann ahuon ding uhi. Tua ni chiengin galkapte Mangpa inn ah Kanaan mi mawngmawng aum nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
</usx>
